---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Contact"
seo_title: "Contact Moview | Feedback, Corrections & Editorial Inquiries"
seo_description: "Get in touch with Moview for editorial feedback, corrections, press screeners, or collaboration inquiries."
permalink: /contact/index.html
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Home"
    url: "/"
  - name: "Contact"
    url: "/contact/"
---

<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:py-14">
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-zinc-400">
    <a href="/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a>
    <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
    <span class="text-zinc-200">Contact</span>
  </nav>

  <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#F5F5F5] sm:text-4xl">
    Contact Moview
  </h1>
  <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
    Have a recommendation, correction, or press inquiry? Send a note below or reach out directly by email.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_280px]">
    <form
      id="moview-contact-form"
      action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit"
      method="POST"
      class="space-y-5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#181A20] p-6"
    >
      <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="{{ site.web3formsKey }}" />
      <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New message from Moview ({{ site.domain }})" />
      <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" class="hidden" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />

      <div>
        <label for="contact-name" class="block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200">Name</label>
        <input
          id="contact-name"
          name="name"
          type="text"
          required
          placeholder="Your name"
          class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-md border border-white/15 bg-[#0E0F13] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-white placeholder-zinc-500 focus:border-[#E50914] focus:outline-none"
        />
      </div>

      <div>
        <label for="contact-email" class="block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200">Email</label>
        <input
          id="contact-email"
          name="email"
          type="email"
          required
          placeholder="you@example.com"
          class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-md border border-white/15 bg-[#0E0F13] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-white placeholder-zinc-500 focus:border-[#E50914] focus:outline-none"
        />
      </div>

      <div>
        <label for="contact-message" class="block text-sm font-medium text-zinc-200">Message</label>
        <textarea
          id="contact-message"
          name="message"
          rows="5"
          required
          placeholder="Share a title suggestion, feedback, or inquiry..."
          class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-md border border-white/15 bg-[#0E0F13] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-white placeholder-zinc-500 focus:border-[#E50914] focus:outline-none"
        ></textarea>
      </div>

      <button
        type="submit"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#E50914] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[#F40612]"
      >
        Send Message
      </button>

      <p id="contact-form-status" class="text-sm text-zinc-400" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>

    <aside class="space-y-5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#181A20] p-6">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white">Direct Email</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-400">
          Prefer your own mail app? Write directly to:
        </p>
        <a
          href="mailto:{{ site.email }}"
          class="mt-2 inline-block break-all text-sm font-medium text-[#E50914] hover:underline underline-offset-4"
        >
          {{ site.email }}
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-4">
        <h2 class="font-display text-base font-semibold text-white">Editorial Notes</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
          Moview does not accept paid reviews or publish sponsored ratings. Official screeners never guarantee positive coverage.
        </p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>
